- Next.js App Router structure
- API routes as secure proxy
- Server-side only Airtable access
- Tailwind CSS styling
- Deployment process

This approach gives you a modern, type-safe codebase while maintaining your secure architecture and making the code much more maintainable with proper field mapping.

